 4... Nc6 {Develops the knight to c6, where it controls e5 and eyes the pawn on d4.}
 5. Nd2 {Develops the knight to d2, where it controls e4.}
 5... d5 {The centre. The pawn on d5 controls c4 and e4. It also opens a line for the queen on d8.}
 6. Ngf3 {Develops the knight to f3, where it controls e5 and supports the pawn on d4.}
